      "text": "I have the picture now. Let me set up a task plan and get started.\n\nThe situation: Ubuntu 24.04 with no compilers/make, but apt and curl/wget are available. I need to build POV-Ray 2.2 (circa 1993, C++ source) and install it to `/usr/local/bin/povray`."
    },
