    {
      "ts": 1786406457409,
      "type": "text",
      "text": "No python3. I'll use grep/sed instead. Let me also install unzip and perl (often needed for older build scripts), and try multiple archive sources in parallel."
    },
    {
      "ts": 1786406457409,
      "type": "tool_start",
      "call": {
        "call_id": "call_3ad7467feb9f4f53a6200262",
        "name": "bash",
        "input": {
          "command": "cd /tmp\necho \"=== Walnut Creek metadata - grep for pov files ===\"\ncurl -s --max-time 30 \"https://archive.org/metadata/Linux_Games_CD-ROM_Walnut_Creek_July_1999/files\" 2>&1 | tr ',' '\\n' | grep -i '\"name\":\"[^\"]*pov' | head -40"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "ts": 1786406457647,
      "type": "tool_result",
      "call_id": "call_3ad7467feb9f4f53a6200262",
      "output": {
        "ok": {
          "content": "=== Walnut Creek metadata - grep for pov files ===\n\n[exit code: 0]\n\nnote: this cd'd to `/tmp`, outside the session root `/app`. Only work under the session root is collected when the turn finishes — every other tool is confined to it, so edits under `/tmp` are invisible to the file tools, to this turn's diff, and to verification. graph_query and the grep/glob code-map footers index only this root, so it isn't covered by the code graph either. To work on that tree, re-root the session on it (run stella from it)."
        }
      },
      "duration_ms": 238,
      "speculated": false
    },
    {
      "ts": 1786406457648,
      "type": "tool_start",
      "call": {
        "call_id": "call_ca304cd4744d43a0aead32a1",
        "name": "bash",
        "input": {
          "command": "export DEBIAN_FRONTEND=noninteractive\napt-get install -y -qq unzip perl 2>&1 | tail -2\nwhich unzip perl",
          "timeout_secs": 120
        }
      }
    },
