      "ts": 1786406502395,
      "type": "text",
      "text": "ibiblio is reachable (200). POV-Ray 2.2 was historically on sunsite/tsx-11. Let me browse ibiblio's graphics directory."
    },
    {
      "ts": 1786406502395,
      "type": "tool_start",
      "call": {
        "call_id": "call_a066b2191fa046289261c800",
        "name": "bash",
        "input": {
          "command": "cd /tmp\necho \"=== ibiblio Linux apps/graphics listing - find pov ===\"\ncurl -s --max-time 25 \"https://www.ibiblio.org/pub/Linux/apps/graphics/\" 2>&1 | grep -io 'href=\"[^\"]*pov[^\"]*\"' | head -30\necho \"=== also look at X11 apps graphics ===\"\ncurl -s --max-time 25 \"https://www.ibiblio.org/pub/Linux/X11/xapps/graphics/\" 2>&1 | grep -io 'href=\"[^\"]*pov[^\"]*\"' | head -30"
        }
      }
    },
