      "ts": 1786406527914,
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Found it. I can see the POV-Ray 2.2 source archives:\n- `povsrc-2.2.tar.gz` (and `povsrc-2.2l2.tar.gz`)\n- `povdoc-2.2.tar.gz` — documentation (the task references `/app/povray-2.2/povdoc/include`, so I need this)\n- `povinc-2.2.tar.gz` — include files (shapes.inc, colors.inc, textures.inc)\n- `povscn-2.2.tar.gz` — scenes\n\nThe POV file uses `#include \"shapes.inc\"`, `colors.inc`, `textures.inc`. The sanity command uses `+L/app/povray-2.2/povdoc/include`. Let me read the README to understand the layout, then download the archives."
    },
    {
