      "type": "text",
      "text": "The \"standard\" build (`povray.s` → uses `unix.o`, only needs `-lm`) is the right target for headless rendering — no X11/svgalib. The CFLAGS use ancient `-m386` which modern gcc rejects. Let me read config.h to understand the default library path and platform config."
