          "content": "{\"ok\":{\"content\":\"=== metadata files content ===\\n{\\\"result\\\":[{\\\"name\\\":\\\"00cover.jpg\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"original\\\",\\\"mtime\\\":\\\"1455844627\\\",\\\"size\\\":\\\"34881\\\",\\\"md5\\\":\\\"5661f5d261c569a5c22b6ac9d62eedc7\\\",\\\"crc32\\\":\\\"f763ff35\\\",\\\"sha1\\\":\\\"c4f28ba7a17d4eb2b834f5fa1e55ca26058b918c\\\",\\\"format\\\":\\\"JPEG\\\",\\\"rotation\\\":\\\"0\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"00cover_thumb.jpg\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"derivative\\\",\\\"format\\\":\\\"JPEG Thumb\\\",\\\"original\\\":\\\"00cover.jpg\\\",\\\"mtime\\\":\\\"1455844645\\\",\\\"size\\\":\\\"4590\\\",\\\"md5\\\":\\\"64589852a43b7bb9fbe06686de78164d\\\",\\\"crc32\\\":\\\"06989aef\\\",\\\"sha1\\\":\\\"0f2f2b7fd4b0cb9080e00ce015984eadf52fd8c3\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"Linux_Games_CD-ROM_Walnut_Creek_July_1999.iso\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"original\\\",\\\"mtime\\\":\\\"1437708879\\\",\\\"size\\\":\\\"310583296\\\",\\\"md5\\\":\\\"e0ede0250298e3a4cdc65e90d1237a80\\\",\\\"crc32\\\":\\\"396afe70\\\",\\\"sha1\\\":\\\"b8e54cad9ff56d1d90ce1f3510f5ab5cba1eed3e\\\",\\\"format\\\":\\\"ISO Image\\\",\\\"filecount\\\":\\\"620\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"Linux_Games_CD-ROM_W\\n[… middle elided during compaction — re-run the tool for the full output …]\\nf6d3d34e046f049f064825150a4cd77c514af1a\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"__ia_thumb.jpg\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"original\\\",\\\"mtime\\\":\\\"1713491916\\\",\\\"size\\\":\\\"9934\\\",\\\"md5\\\":\\\"8a4cb5d33e05a45536df1beb93ddadd4\\\",\\\"crc32\\\":\\\"72db00ea\\\",\\\"sha1\\\":\\\"2ccd1465507f8928706533e154ffd660bfcdefab\\\",\\\"format\\\":\\\"Item Tile\\\",\\\"rotation\\\":\\\"0\\\"}]}\\n=== try /metadata/ full dir listing ===\\nmeta size: 7301 bytes\\n\\n[exit code: 0]\\n\\nnote: this cd'd to `/tmp`, outside the session root `/app`. Only work under the session root is collected when the turn finishes — every other tool is confined to it, so edits under `/tmp` are invisible to the file tools, to this turn's diff, and to verification. graph_query and the grep/glob code-map footers index only this root, so it isn't covered by the code graph either. To work on that tree, re-root the session on it (run stella from it).\"}}"
