          "content": "{\"ok\":{\"content\":\"     1\\t# Makefile for Persistence of Vision Raytracer\\n     2\\t# This file is released to the public domain.\\n     3\\t#\\n     4\\t# make all \\t\\tcreates the executables\\n     5\\t# make installx \\tinstalls the X binary\\n     6\\t# make installs \\tinstalls the standard binary\\n     7\\t# make installv\\t\\tinstalls the svgalib binary -- YOU MUST BE ROOT TO DO THIS\\n     8\\t#\\n     9\\t# MAKE Macros and Such...\\n    10\\t#\\n    11\\t\\n    12\\t#***************************************************************\\n    13\\t#*\\n    14\\t#*                      UNIX Makefile\\n    15\\t#*\\n    16\\t#***************************************************************\\n    17\\t\\n    18\\t\\n    19\\tOBJ\\t= o\\n    20\\tCFLAGS=\\t\\t-pipe -m386 -c -O2 -ffast-math -funroll-loops -fcaller-saves -fomit-frame-pointer -finline-functions\\n    21\\tLFLAGS =\\t-O2 -L/usr/X386/lib\\n    22\\n[… middle elided during compaction — re-run the tool for the full output …]\\nBIN)/povray\\n   145\\t#\\tgzexe $(INSTBIN)/povray\\n   146\\t\\n   147\\tinstallv: $(BINDIR)/povray.v\\n   148\\t\\techo I hope you\\\\'re root.  Otherwise, this won't work.\\n   149\\t\\tmv $(BINDIR)/povray.v $(INSTBIN)/povray\\n   150\\t\\tstrip $(INSTBIN)/povray\\n   151\\t\\tchmod 4755 $(INSTBIN)/povray\\n   152\\t\\tchown root.root $(INSTBIN)/povray\\n   153\\t#\\tgzexe $(INSTBIN)/povray\\n   154\\t\\n   155\\tclean:\\n   156\\t\\trm *.o $(BINDIR)/povray.s $(BINDIR)/povray.v $(BINDIR)/povray.x\\n   157\\t\\n   158\\txwindows.o: xwindows.c xpov.icn\\n   159\\t# If you want povray to always pause at the end of a render, add -DWAIT_ON_COMPLETION\\n   160\\t# If you want to enable the ordered dither hack, add -DCDITHER\\n   161\\t# to the end of the line below\\n   162\\t\\t$(CC) $(CFLAGS) -o xwindows.o xwindows.c -DCDITHER\\n   163\\t\\n\\n(163/163 lines shown · read 1× this session)\"}}"
