    {
      "ts": 1786406721107,
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Now I have the full picture. The standard build `povray.s` only needs `unix.o` + `-lm` — perfect for headless rendering. I'll patch the Makefile: replace the obsolete `-m386`/`-fcaller-saves` flags that modern gcc rejects, and set `INSTBIN` to `/usr/local/bin`."
    },
    {
      "ts": 1786406721107,
      "type": "tool_start",
      "call": {
        "call_id": "call_159fa69ce59445b3803242af",
        "name": "edit_file",
        "input": {
          "new_string": "OBJ\t= o\nCFLAGS=\t\t-pipe -c -O2 -ffast-math -funroll-loops -fomit-frame-pointer -finline-functions\nLFLAGS =\t-O2\nCC =            gcc\nBINDIR = ../bin\nINSTBIN = /usr/local/bin",
          "old_string": "OBJ\t= o\nCFLAGS=\t\t-pipe -m386 -c -O2 -ffast-math -funroll-loops -fcaller-saves -fomit-frame-pointer -finline-functions\nLFLAGS =\t-O2 -L/usr/X386/lib\nCC =            gcc\nBINDIR = ../bin\nINSTBIN = $(HOME)/bin",
          "path": "/app/povray-2.2/pov/source/Makefile",
          "reason": "Modernize build flags for contemporary gcc (drop obsolete -m386/-fcaller-saves and stale X386 lib path) and set install target to /usr/local/bin as required."
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "ts": 1786406721119,
