      "type": "text",
      "text": "The exit codes in source are all `exit(1)`. Exit code 87 is unusual. Let me check what happens — it might be from the `+P` (pause) flag waiting for input, or from writing to `/dev/null`. Let me look at where 87 could come from, and test without `+P`."
    },
    {
      "ts": 1786406765214,
      "type": "tool_start",
      "call": {
        "call_id": "call_58a63f58c37a4d02abc54e5e",
        "name": "bash",
        "input": {
          "command": "echo \"=== Test WITHOUT +P (pause) and to a real file ===\"\ncd /tmp\n/usr/local/bin/povray +L/app/povray-2.2/povdoc/include +I/app/deps/illum1.pov +O/tmp/out.tga -V 2>&1 | tail -8\necho \"=== EXIT CODE: ${PIPESTATUS[0]} ===\"\necho \"=== output file ===\"\nls -la /tmp/out.tga 2>/dev/null"
        }
      }
    },
