    {
      "ts": 1786406824519,
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Very interesting — under gdb with `-O0` debug build, it **\"exited normally\"**! No crash. So the crash is either:\n1. Optimization-dependent (the `-O0` build doesn't crash but `-O2` does), or\n2. ASLR-dependent (gdb noted it couldn't disable ASLR; the crash may be masked under gdb's memory layout).\n\nThe \"exited normally\" under gdb is suspicious given ASLR couldn't be disabled. Let me test the `-O0` debug build directly (not under gdb) to see if it crashes."
    },
