    {
      "ts": 1786406858483,
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Now with `-g` (debug symbols), `-O2 -ffast-math` works fine. The issue must be one of the other flags: `-ffast-math -funroll-loops -fomit-frame-pointer -finline-functions`. Earlier my `make` build used `-O2 -ffast-math -funroll-loops -fomit-frame-pointer -finline-functions` (no `-g`) and crashed. Let me test the exact combination minus `-g`, and isolate the culprit."
    },
    {
      "ts": 1786406858483,
      "type": "tool_start",
      "call": {
        "call_id": "call_90beeb0889204516807b9442",
        "name": "bash",
        "input": {
          "command": "cd /app/povray-2.2/pov/source\nOBJS=\"povray bezier blob bound boxes camera colour cones csg discs dump express gif gifdecod hfield iff image lighting matrices normal objects parse pigment planes point poly quadrics raw ray render spheres targa texture tokenize triangle txttest vect unix\"\nbuildtest() {\n  local label=\"$1\"; shift\n  local flags=\"$@\"\n  rm -f *.o\n  for o in $OBJS; do gcc -c $flags -o ${o}.o ${o}.c 2>/dev/null; done\n  OBJFILES=\"\"; for o in $OBJS; do OBJFILES=\"$OBJFILES ${o}.o\"; done\n  gcc $flags $OBJFILES -o ../bin/povtest -lm 2>/dev/null\n  local codes=\"\"\n  for i in 1 2 3; do\n    ../bin/povtest +L/app/povray-2.2/povdoc/include +I/app/deps/illum1.pov +O/tmp/out.tga +W32 +H32 -V >/dev/null 2>&1\n    codes=\"$codes $?\"\n  done\n  echo \"[$label] exits:$codes\"\n}\n# Reproduce the crash with exact make flags (no -g)\nbuildtest \"full-makeflags\" -pipe -O2 -ffast-math -funroll-loops -fomit-frame-pointer -finline-functions\nbuildtest \"O2\" -O2\nbuildtest \"O2-unroll\" -O2 -funroll-loops\nbuildtest \"O2-omitfp\" -O2 -fomit-frame-pointer\nbuildtest \"O2-inline\" -O2 -finline-functions"
        }
      }
    },
