      "type": "text",
      "text": "Mostly 0 but run 4 gave exit 53 — still an occasional crash even without `-funroll-loops`. The `+O/dev/null` path is special. Let me investigate: is it `/dev/null` specifically, or residual instability? Let me test `/dev/null` vs a real file, and more iterations."
    },
