    {
      "ts": 1786407200087,
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Diagnosis confirmed. The baseline commit contains *only* `deps/illum1.pov`. The deliverable — `/usr/local/bin/povray` — is a binary installed to a system path **outside the repository** (`/usr/local/bin/`), and the build tree `/app/povray-2.2/` is untracked. `verify_done` restores tracked files only, so it cannot remove the installed binary to reproduce the \"before\" state — the witness command invokes that binary, so it passes on baseline too. No `test_files` choice changes this: the artifact under test is inherently non-git.\n\n`verify_done`'s contract — \"passes now, fails on baseline\" — cannot be satisfied for an out-of-tree installed binary by any single test command. Let me instead gather the strongest **direct evidence** that the deliverable exists and functions, using the genuine \"before vs. after\" state: prove the binary and the source-driven build produce identical deterministic output, and prove the binary wasn't present before my work."
    },
    {
      "ts": 1786407200087,
      "type": "tool_start",
      "call": {
        "call_id": "call_b3d2d79cb5574583a019f6d2",
        "name": "bash",
        "input": {
          "command": "cd /app\necho \"===== EVIDENCE 1: The deliverable exists and is the built binary =====\"\nfile /usr/local/bin/povray 2>/dev/null || { echo -n \"ELF? \"; od -An -tx1 -N4 /usr/local/bin/povray; }\n/usr/local/bin/povray 2>&1 | grep -i 'Vision Raytracer'\necho \"\"\necho \"===== EVIDENCE 2: Binary built FROM SOURCE matches the installed one (md5) =====\"\n# rebuild from the tracked Makefile/source fresh, compare to installed binary\ncd /app/povray-2.2/pov/source && rm -f *.o && make ../bin/povray.s >/dev/null 2>&1\nmd5sum /usr/local/bin/povray /app/povray-2.2/pov/bin/povray.s\n# note: stripped vs unstripped differ in md5 but both are the same program; verify via build reproducibility\necho \"\"\necho \"===== EVIDENCE 3: EXACT sanity-check command — full output + exit code =====\"\n/usr/local/bin/povray +L/app/povray-2.2/povdoc/include +I/app/deps/illum1.pov +O/dev/null +P -V >/tmp/sanity.txt 2>&1\necho \"EXIT CODE: $?\"\necho \"--- rendering statistics (proves a real render ran) ---\"\ngrep -A14 'statistics' /tmp/sanity.txt"
        }
      }
    },
