      "diff": "@@ -1,0 +1,56 @@\n+Persistence of Vision Raytracer Version 2.0\n+--------------------------------------------\n+These are the level 2 example scene files for use with the Persistence\n+of Vision Raytracer version 2.0.\n+  \n+To use the POV-Ray ray tracer, you also need POVDOC.ZIP for documentation, \n+and an executable for your computer. See the file POVINFO.TXT for\n+more information.\n+\n+These files should be available from the same source from where \n+you received this file.\n+------------------------------------------------------------------------\n+\n+\n+Files contained in LEVEL2 sub-directory\n+---------------------------------------\n+ARCHES.POV    <- Arches standing in water - an Aquatic McDonalds?\n+CLUSTER.POV   <- A cluster of mirrored spheres - classic test scene\n+CRYSTAL.POV   <- A Crystal Ball on a Checkerboard - classic IOR test\n+EIGHT.POV     <- Behind the 8-Ball!\n+EIGHT.IFF     <- Image map for EIGHT.POV\n+FRACT003.GIF  <- Image/Height map for SUNSETHF.POV\n+HFCLIP.POV    <- Height Field Clipped (Fractured) dowel\n+ILLUM1.POV    <- Stacked Glass Balls - Illumination test 1\n+ILLUM2.POV    <- Stacked Glass Balls - Illumination test 2\n+IORTEST.POV   <- IOR Test\n+LAMPPOST.POV  <- Old fashioned lamppost on a reflective floor\n+LEVEL2.CAT    <- This description file\n+LPOPS1.POV    <- Surreal Lollipops 1\n+LPOPS2.POV    <- Surreal Lollipops 2\n+MAGGLASS.POV  <- Magnifying Glass\n+MTMANDJ.GIF   <- Low resolution version of bump map for MTMAND.POV\n+MTMAND.POT    <- Low resolution version of height field for MTMAND.POV\n+MTMAND.PAR    <- FRACTINT Parameter file for MTMAND Fractal\n+MTMAND.POV    <- Mount Mandelbrot! - 3-D Mandelscape\n+PACMAN.IFF    <- Image map for PACMAN.POV\n+PACMAN.POV    <- Our Hero!  Pac-Man doing what he does best!\n+PAWNS.POV     <- Three pawns on a chessboard - wood study\n+PLANET.POV    <- So this is how they do the STNG title scenes!\n+PLASMA2.GIF   <- Image/Height map for HFCLIP.POV\n+POLYWOOD.POV  <- Wooden Polyhedron CSG on a grassy hill\n+POOLBALL.INC  <- Include file for POOLBALL.POV\n+POOLBALL.POV  <- A collection of pool balls on a table w/cue\n+ROMO.POV      <- Reflections of a fertility symbol\n+ROOM.POV      <- Empty Room for designing your own scenes\n+SKYVASE.POV   <- Interesting use of Sky texture for a marble vase\n+SMOKE.POV     <- Dark smoky glass ball (\"black\" filter test)\n+SOFT.POV      <- The letters \"SOFT\" casting soft-shadows (Area Lights)\n+SPLINE.INC    <- Include file for SPLINE.POV\n+SPLINE.POV    <- Bezier Spline Test - the word \"Merry\" w/checkers\n+STONEWAL.POV  <- A Stone Wall, Jackson!\n+SUNSETHF.POV  <- Sunset over the Height Field Mountain Range\n+TETRA.POV     <- 4 Tetrahedrons\n+WATERBOW.POV  <- A small bowl with water in it on a wood table\n+WTORUS.POV    <- A wooden torus!\n+\n"
